    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moovingo is delighted to present 70 WIlliam Bligh, a superb 5th floor, one bedroom apartment in this much sought after and desirable development in Dublin 4. This light filled, spacious accommodation enjoys wonderful views of the Aviva Stadium and the Dublin skyline and is presented in turnkey condition.\r\n\r\nA wonderful sense of space and light prevails throughout this apartment due to the large floor to ceiling double glazed windows throughout. The generous (54 sq. m) accommodation comprises an entrance hallway, utility room, double bedroom, family size bathroom, fully fitted kitchen, living room with dining area and patio door leading to a good size balcony overlooking the Aviva stadium and the iconic Gasometer Building.\r\n\r\nThis well managed apartment complex is attractively landscaped and has an on-site caretaker. This property will not fail to impress the most discerning of buyers from  to investors. Viewing of this superb apartment is highly recommended to truly appreciate all that is on offer.\r\n\r\nArea Info:\r\n\r\nThe William Bligh is ideally positioned within The Gasworks development in Dublin 4, offering excellent access to the city centre and surrounding areas. Grand Canal Dock DART Station is just a short walk away, providing convenient transport links throughout the city, while Ballsbridge, Sandymount, the IFSC, Trinity College and the city centre are all within easy reach. The area is also home to a number of major employers, including Google, TikTok and Accenture, making this an excellent location for  working in the city and surrounding business districts.\r\n\r\nA wide selection of shops, cafés, bars, restaurants and everyday amenities can be found close by, particularly around Barrow Street, Bath Avenue, Beggars Bush and Grand Canal Dock. The area also benefits from its proximity to the Aviva Stadium, Bord Gáis Energy Theatre, Convention Centre Dublin and 3Arena. The development has pedestrian access from both South Lotts Road and Barrow Street, with a number of bus routes operating nearby, further adding to the convenience of this highly sought-after Dublin 4 location.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Any intending purchaser(s) shall accept that no statement, description or measurement contained in advertisement or any other document or published by the vendor or by Moovingo, in respect of the premises shall constitute a representation inducing the purchaser(s) to enter into any contract for sale, or any warranty forming part of any such contract for sale. Any such statement, description or measurement, whether in writing or in oral form, given by the vendor, or by Moovingo, are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any intending purchaser(s) shall satisfy themselves by inspection, survey or otherwise as to the correctness of same. No omission, misstatement, misdescription, incorrect measurement or error of any description, whether given orally or in any written form by the vendor or by Moovingo, shall give rise to any claim for compensation against the vendor or against Moovingo. Any intending purchaser(s) are deemed to fully satisfy themselves in relation to all such matters."
      },
